38205>>>>>>>    Procedure SetActionButtons
38208>>>>>>>        tWebNavigateData NavigateData
38208>>>>>>>        tWebNavigateData NavigateData
38208>>>>>>>        Boolean bHasRecord
38208>>>>>>>        Handle hoDD
38208>>>>>>>
38208>>>>>>>        Get Server to hoDD
38209>>>>>>>        Get GetNavigateData to NavigateData
38210>>>>>>>        Get HasRecord of hoDD to bHasRecord
38211>>>>>>>
38211>>>>>>>        // let's hide all buttons and then Show the ones we want
38211>>>>>>>        WebSet pbRender of oEditBtn to False
38212>>>>>>>        WebSet pbRender of oSaveBtn to False
38213>>>>>>>        WebSet pbRender of oCancelChangesBtn to False
38214>>>>>>>        WebSet pbRender of oDeleteBtn to False
38215>>>>>>>        WebSet pbRender of oBtnVerEquipos to True
38216>>>>>>>
